d family to his skin, turning it ash-white and earning him the nickname, "Ghost of Sparta". Plagued by nightmares of his horrible deed, Kratos vowed to serve the other gods in hope of ridding himself of the visions.	{"PlayStation 2"}	{"Third person"}	{"Single player"}	{"SCE Santa Monica Studio"}	{"God of War"}	{551,499,552,6958,533,550,571,127,2031,1009}	2026-05-05 17:49:52.132678
