arents, families grow, and Sims grow old. Not only does this go hand in hand with aspirations (growing up is the first aspiration that a baby Sim will have), it provides a limited time with which your Sims can achieve their goals.\n\nThe pre-made households all have backstories that are smart spoofs of soap-opera plots--lots of scheming, romance, ghosts, and family fighting.	{"PC (Microsoft Windows)",Mac}	{"Bird view / Isometric"}	{"Single player"}	{Maxis}	{"The Sims"}	{260,223,3212,111187,1020,26574,26145,18337,10297,1879}	2026-05-05 17:49:52.754583
