r his new planet. Fearing that Drek will destroy everything in his path, Ratchet and Clank team up for their first explosive adventure to save the galaxy.	{"PlayStation 2"}	{"Third person"}	{"Single player"}	{"Insomniac Games"}	{"Ratchet & Clank"}	{1773,1528,1791,1792,1790,1530,1529,1795,843,1006}	2026-05-05 17:49:55.241186
