at happened next.	{"PlayStation 3",PlayStation,"PlayStation Portable"}	{"First person"}	{"Single player",Multiplayer}	{"Dreamworks Interactive"}	{}	{1309,621,617,5647,622,1308,2031,949,241,277}	2026-05-05 17:49:58.17819
