te power. Upon defeating Eggman, Sonic finds a Sol Emerald that Eggman dropped, at which point Blaze appears and reclaims it, thanking Sonic for defeating Eggman before leaving. Confused, Sonic teams up with Tails to figure out what is going on while collecting the Chaos Emeralds.	{"Nintendo DS"}	{"Side view"}	{"Single player",Multiplayer,Co-operative}	{"Sonic Team"}	{"Sonic The Hedgehog"}	{6283,4156,7858,21062,5452,3166,20342,5167,6599,9061}	2026-05-05 17:50:01.816184
