s triggered. Hawke takes over as leader of Black Hole, and along with Flak, Lash, and Adder, leaves Macro Land with the few troops he has left.	{"Wii U","Game Boy Advance"}	{"Bird view / Isometric"}	{"Single player",Multiplayer}	{"Intelligent Systems"}	{Wars}	{8422,1691,15894,10964,9363,14394,58075,848,19354,587}	2026-05-05 17:50:05.837042
