ailable to them to get the job done. It is possible to commandeer tanks, choppers and and any other military hardware to blow up the game's destructible landscape across the North Korean countryside. Helping out various factions provides access to numerous vehicle drops, supply drops, and air strikes.	\N	{Xbox,"PlayStation 2"}	{"Third person"}	{"Single player"}	{"Pandemic Studios"}	{}	{1020,564,19441,2684,1121,296,2031,1985,733,40}	2026-05-05 17:50:07.865159
