ouls to see the day again and sent them to Arius, and the reincarnation began.\n\nAs the reborn souls continue to live in their new bodies, they remembered the mistakes they made in their previous lives and did not repeat them. Thanks to this, they developed rapidly, and the civilization of such people, the glorious Protean Empire, was born.	{"PC (Microsoft Windows)"}	{"Third person"}	{"Massively Multiplayer Online (MMO)"}	{"Rokogame Studios"}	{}	{81249,115653,19164,23651,49414,19404,54775,37382,106987,113910}	2026-05-05 17:50:08.309553
