9e274e0c-c29f-4f43-8623-42283beda12e	305296	Hunter Moonstrike	hunter-moonstrike	co96tr	2025-01-23	2025	Hunter Moonstrike is the first survival game integrated with artificial intelligence. In this game, all npc have their own unique story and you can see the story of the game from their point of view. Talk to any person, ask any question you like, they will answer and think they are alive	The Enigma of MOON\n\nIn the chaotic aftermath of the zombie apocalypse, when hope seemed all but lost, a new threat emerged from the shadows—Moon , a ruthless and enigmatic figure who would come to dominate the forest landscape. His origins shrouded in mystery, Moon’s true identity remained a closely guarded secret, hidden behind a mask that concealed his every feature.\n\nAmassing a formidable band of loyal followers, Moon quickly established himself as a force to be reckoned with. His modus operandi was simple yet effective: he would target the weaker camps, extorting their precious resources through a combination of intimidation and brute force. Moon’s insatiable thirst for power and control knew no bounds, and he would stop at nothing to maintain his dominance over the forest.\n\nHanks, the resolute leader of Camp One, was among the first to recognize the imminent danger posed by Moon . A seasoned military veteran, Hanks had honed his survival skills in the wilderness, and he understood the importance of unity and resilience in the face of such a formidable adversary. Yet, even as he harbored a deep-seated enmity towards Moon , Hanks remained uncertain about the true extent of his rival’s resources and capabilities\n\nMoon’s true strength lay not only in his physical prowess and the loyalty of his followers but also in the veil of secrecy that shrouded his every move. He was a master of deception, always keeping his face hidden behind the mask, and his subordinates were fiercely devoted to maintaining his anonymity. This aura of mystery only served to amplify Moon’s reputation, striking fear into the hearts of those who dared to challenge his authority.\n\nAs Hanks and his camp struggled to maintain their fragile existence, the threat of Moon loomed ever larger. The conflict between the two leaders had become a battle of wits, with Hanks constantly seeking ways to outmaneuver his elusive foe. Yet, with Moon’s resources and influence growing by the day, the stakes had never been higher, and the fate of the forest – and perhaps even the remnants of humanity – hung in the balance.	{"PC (Microsoft Windows)"}	{"First person"}	{"Single player"}	{10nstudio}	{}	{102584,26574,17379,19164,17548,44076,105269,19561,25300,10776}	2026-05-05 17:50:13.718398
