hich resembles a simplified Baroque fugue.	\N	{Arcade,"Commodore C64/128/MAX","ZX Spectrum","Atari ST/STE",DOS,Amiga,"Amstrad CPC","Nintendo Entertainment System"}	{"Bird view / Isometric"}	{"Single player",Multiplayer,Co-operative}	{"Atari Games"}	{}	{103168,54775,106987,96217,5867,103369,19164,81249,55038,55199}	2026-05-05 17:50:16.854269
