r Monster Hunter games, but is not named in the original. The player then meets what is known as the "Wyvern Blood's Call," and is met with the appearance of the Black Dragon "Fatalis," the online final boss. After slaying this evil dragon, the town and Kingdom is safe, and the player is regarded as a hero.	{"PlayStation 2"}	{"Third person"}	{"Single player",Multiplayer,Co-operative}	{Capcom}	{"Monster Hunter"}	{17379,10776,9243,27092,26574,105049,28168,47823,36198,17548}	2026-05-05 17:50:20.721398
