ting Brian\nWe finally learn some of what happened between the ending of Runaway 2 and the opening of this game. Also, Gina gets tied up as Tarantula catches up with her.\n\nChapter 6: The End is Here\nBrian comes up with a plan to defeat Tarantula and her goons, exonerate himself and rescue Gina. The series is brought to a fitting ending.	{"PC (Microsoft Windows)",iOS,"Nintendo DS"}	{"Side view"}	{"Single player"}	{"Pendulo Studios"}	{}	{19164,24426,55984,89597,96217,18225,106987,18167,28309,80916}	2026-05-05 17:50:23.183731
